[node name="npc1" parent="." unique_id=1646254127 instance=ExtResource("5_rq305")]
position = Vector2(488, 280)
npc_name = "Laura the Lost"
dialogue_text = "So... many... trees...

No... way... back...

Sorry guy, I'm having a rough time... I came here quite a while ago looking for something I had heard about from the locals. A chest of some kind, holding something that only a chest in this world can... 

I'm not from around here if you couldn't pick up on that already. But where I live, chests don't really hold much.. Maybe some gold, some extra resources from stuff I can already gather from, even a piece of gear here and there, but it feels like it's never worth it.. All of it just gets replaced, wasted time, wasted effort.. and for what? Something replaceable? Something fleeting?... 

Anyway, that's the world I come from. But in this world, it's a different story... The locals tell me that every chest you find in this world has something special, something unique... something you cannot get anywhere else, something you can't just find on the ground at some point. 

I longed for the day where my efforts would be rewarded. I wanted a quest that was actually worth completing... So I came here looking for it. There's a chest in these woods somewhere, I KNOW IT! And that's why I can't turn around now, not that I could retrace my steps anyway... 

Take care guy... Hopefully you make it back out okay."
wander_radius_blocks = 0.0

